WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:14.714
<i> NARRATOR: Power is
 not a birth right.</i>

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:21.321
<i> It's earned with teeth,</i>

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:25.058
<i> and claws,</i>

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:28.595
<i> and sacrifice.</i>

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.835
<i> Savagery wins wars.</i>

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:49.249 align:start size:78% position:22%
<i> If you're strong
 enough to seize it,</i>

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:58.224
<i> this new kingdom
 will be yours.</i>

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:18.778
<i> For generations kings
 and queens have reigned</i>

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:21.514
<i> well over Mombo.</i>

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:30.090 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> A bountiful Eden
 far south of Savute.</i>

00:01:45.804 --> 00:01:50.643 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> But they now face the greatest
 threat to their long rule.</i>

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:02.655 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> A rebel army is
 rising from the shadows.</i>

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:14.467 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> Led by Mmamotse,
 commander of the damned.</i>

00:02:19.705 --> 00:02:24.244 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> The abundant land
 fuels her savage ranks.</i>

00:02:33.652 --> 00:02:38.758
<i> She now has enough soldiers
 to lay siege to the kingdom.</i>

00:02:50.569 --> 00:02:53.239
<i> No more hiding
 in the darkness,</i>

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:56.276
<i> eating scraps.</i>

00:03:00.612 --> 00:03:04.584 align:start size:75% position:25%
<i> Mmamotse wants
 the lion's share.</i>

00:03:08.854 --> 00:03:11.391
<i> She wants it all.</i>

00:03:15.194 --> 00:03:18.498
<i> She wants the throne.</i>

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:30.910
<i> The king had nothing
 to fear until now.</i>

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:51.698
<i> The tide is turning.</i>

00:04:03.609 --> 00:04:08.314
<i> But reigning queens do
 not surrender lightly.</i>

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:17.390
<i> Perhaps a truce?</i>

00:04:20.426 --> 00:04:24.964 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> Only a fool could
 believe such nonsense.</i>

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:45.285
<i> Time to reveal the full
 force of her hidden army.</i>

00:04:50.322 --> 00:04:56.696
(growling).

00:05:00.533 --> 00:05:06.773
(hyenas laughing).

00:05:13.645 --> 00:05:18.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> Mmamotse sets her unstoppable
 virus loose on Eden.</i>

00:05:29.528 --> 00:05:34.033
<i> Her new regime feeds
 on fear and violence.</i>

00:05:39.538 --> 00:05:44.377
<i> You will all now bow to me.</i>

00:05:55.187 --> 00:05:58.090
<i> Under Mmamotse's
 wretched reign,</i>

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:03.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> life in the kingdom is
 about to change for everyone.</i>

00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:16.142
<i> Pula rules the forest.</i>

00:06:19.245 --> 00:06:23.148 align:start size:78% position:22%
<i> The beating
 heart of the realm.</i>

00:06:23.682 --> 00:06:28.921
<i> Her torn ear, just one of
 a decade's worth of scars.</i>

00:06:35.428 --> 00:06:39.399 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> From battles fought,
 and battles won.</i>

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:46.706
<i> Not born into royalty, Pula
 works hard for her dominion.</i>

00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:57.817
<i> But her success is
 marred by tragedy.</i>

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:06.426
<i> She has only one
 surviving heir.</i>

00:07:08.293 --> 00:07:13.132
<i> This season could be her final
 chance to further her legacy.</i>

00:07:23.176 --> 00:07:27.246
<i> She will be strong and ready.</i>

00:07:35.254 --> 00:07:39.759
<i> The advantage of high
 position in paradise,</i>

00:07:42.495 --> 00:07:46.999 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> there's always a
 seat at the high table.</i>

00:08:02.848 --> 00:08:09.121
(growling, gazelle groans).

00:08:41.087 --> 00:08:45.791
<i> Sheer will earns this
 humble-born her wealth.</i>

00:08:57.469 --> 00:09:01.274 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> A firm grip
 ensures she keeps it.</i>

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:16.722
<i> Hide your riches and eat fast.</i>

00:09:19.224 --> 00:09:22.929
<i> Thieves are everywhere.</i>

00:09:27.032 --> 00:09:31.637
<i> Every bite makes
 Pula stronger.</i>

00:09:35.707 --> 00:09:39.712
<i> But the truly wise
 know when to yield.</i>

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:58.196
(hyenas laughing).

00:09:58.563 --> 00:10:01.834
<i> Let the tyrants
 take their tax.</i>

00:10:16.015 --> 00:10:20.419
<i> There's plenty more
 where that came from.</i>

00:10:22.821 --> 00:10:25.825
<i> But dark times are coming.</i>

00:10:39.104 --> 00:10:41.106
<i> NARRATOR: Shattered
 monarchs drift in</i>

00:10:41.206 --> 00:10:44.443 align:start size:78% position:22%
<i> fragments of their
 former prides.</i>

00:10:47.579 --> 00:10:53.452
<i> But three stubborn warriors
 remain in the promised land.</i>

00:10:55.721 --> 00:11:00.092
<i> Led by Sega with
 only half a tail.</i>

00:11:04.964 --> 00:11:09.201 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> The sisters of the
 Matahta pride are stranded.</i>

00:11:10.769 --> 00:11:13.673
<i> Their family is scattered.</i>

00:11:22.515 --> 00:11:26.018
<i> But their will is
 far from broken.</i>

00:11:54.846 --> 00:11:59.151 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> Sega must rebuild her
 pride from the ground up.</i>

00:12:10.061 --> 00:12:13.966
<i> One little piggy at a time.</i>

00:12:23.476 --> 00:12:27.780
<i> She has her own hidden secret.</i>

00:12:33.552 --> 00:12:37.490
<i> Six young heirs.</i>

00:12:39.891 --> 00:12:43.496
<i> Future kings and queens.</i>

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:48.200
<i> The foundations
 of a new empire.</i>

00:12:54.773 --> 00:12:58.477
<i> Her sisters share the burden.</i>

00:13:03.949 --> 00:13:08.354
<i> And the babysitting.</i>

00:13:12.124 --> 00:13:16.095 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> A relentless
 onslaught of tiny teeth.</i>

00:13:19.899 --> 00:13:25.571
(meowing).

00:13:25.938 --> 00:13:30.276
<i> Their hunger bodes well
 for the pride's fortunes,</i>

00:13:38.216 --> 00:13:43.489
<i> if Sega can keep them alive
 and teach them some manners.</i>

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:50.496
(meowing).

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:09.448
<i> This ravenous horde will
 one day rule the kingdom.</i>

00:14:25.297 --> 00:14:29.501 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> The balance of power
 can shift in an instant.</i>

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:39.378
<i> But there's always one
 who swaggers with ease</i>

00:14:39.478 --> 00:14:42.514
<i> through the wreckage.</i>

00:14:49.421 --> 00:14:54.426 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> Blue Eyes, the most
 charming leopard in the realm.</i>

00:15:00.632 --> 00:15:05.271 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> He's making his rounds,
 staking his claims.</i>

00:15:06.871 --> 00:15:11.010
<i> Quite the perfect specimen.</i>

00:15:26.492 --> 00:15:31.664
(snorting, squealing).

00:15:41.506 --> 00:15:46.512
<i> He didn't really feel
 like warthog anyway.</i>

00:15:50.148 --> 00:15:53.719
<i> Blue Eyes is not
 here for food.</i>

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:02.361
<i> He's here for Pula.</i>

00:16:03.095 --> 00:16:07.333
<i> She only has eyes for him.</i>

00:16:15.507 --> 00:16:18.610
<i> Vanity aside,</i>

00:16:21.379 --> 00:16:25.317
<i> he is proud and strong</i>

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:33.625 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> and Pula's best chance
 to further her bloodline.</i>

00:16:42.968 --> 00:16:49.575
♪ ♪

00:17:06.357 --> 00:17:09.895 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> With him by her side,
 her legacy could last for</i>

00:17:09.995 --> 00:17:14.099
<i> generations to come.</i>

00:17:33.851 --> 00:17:37.823
<i> The young are the future.</i>

00:17:47.699 --> 00:17:52.304
<i> Sega's pride grows
 stronger every day.</i>

00:17:59.043 --> 00:18:02.281
<i> These cubs will be warriors.</i>

00:18:03.682 --> 00:18:08.654
<i> But for now, they depend on
 their mothers for everything.</i>

00:18:13.425 --> 00:18:17.162
<i> Protect them at all costs.</i>

00:18:34.446 --> 00:18:38.483
<i> Inside their creche,
 the world is safe.</i>

00:18:38.583 --> 00:18:43.188 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> But there's always one
 born bolder than the rest.</i>

00:18:53.231 --> 00:18:55.801
<i> Adventure lures the
 curious cub away from</i>

00:18:55.901 --> 00:18:59.371
<i> his mother's cautious eye.</i>

00:19:07.646 --> 00:19:11.950
<i> He's yet to learn the
 dangers of the wild.</i>

00:19:25.597 --> 00:19:29.234
<i> An innocent spirit
 in a ruthless world.</i>

00:20:13.645 --> 00:20:19.918
♪ ♪

00:20:25.857 --> 00:20:30.262 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> NARRATOR: A mother's
 intuition is seldom wrong.</i>

00:20:36.201 --> 00:20:40.339
<i> A head count confirms</i>

00:20:44.042 --> 00:20:47.746
<i> one cub is missing.</i>

00:20:56.521 --> 00:21:00.292
<i> Sega issues a call to arms.</i>

00:21:05.997 --> 00:21:09.300
<i> Where is he?</i>

00:21:09.401 --> 00:21:16.008
(roaring).

00:21:22.047 --> 00:21:26.351 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> Search as they may,
 their efforts are in vain.</i>

00:21:39.297 --> 00:21:43.035
<i> Blue Eyes has seen to that.</i>

00:21:49.741 --> 00:21:53.812 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> A mother's grief
 means nothing to him.</i>

00:21:58.216 --> 00:22:03.055 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> It's just an easy meal
 and one less future rival.</i>

00:22:06.658 --> 00:22:10.929
<i> Sega has not only lost
 a valuable soldier,</i>

00:22:12.063 --> 00:22:15.067
<i> but a son.</i>

00:22:38.457 --> 00:22:43.695
(thunder).

00:23:01.046 --> 00:23:05.617 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> Rain cannot
 cleanse a wicked world.</i>

00:23:14.192 --> 00:23:18.830
<i> But here in Mombo it
 does reset the game.</i>

00:23:29.808 --> 00:23:34.746 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> In this kingdom,
 water is the real power.</i>

00:23:57.636 --> 00:24:01.740
<i> The new season delivers
 all Pula ever wanted.</i>

00:24:13.151 --> 00:24:16.053
(meowing).

00:24:16.253 --> 00:24:20.225
<i> This is Motshidi.</i>

00:24:20.992 --> 00:24:24.795 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> Welcome to the
 world, my little one.</i>

00:24:25.096 --> 00:24:29.768
<i> Pula's destiny now rests
 on your tiny shoulders.</i>

00:24:47.018 --> 00:24:50.956
<i> Blue Eyes is not
 to be trusted.</i>

00:24:57.428 --> 00:25:01.967
<i> He's killed his
 own cubs before.</i>

00:25:11.576 --> 00:25:15.814 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> Pula cannot risk
 his dark side again.</i>

00:25:25.891 --> 00:25:30.161
<i> Only he knows why he
 would kill his own.</i>

00:25:46.544 --> 00:25:49.781 line:0%
<i> NARRATOR: Pula has got what
 she needed from Blue Eyes.</i>

00:25:53.518 --> 00:25:57.355 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> Now she must protect
 her investment.</i>

00:26:01.459 --> 00:26:04.596
<i> Leave us alone!</i>

00:26:24.716 --> 00:26:28.954
<i> You are no longer welcome.</i>

00:26:33.491 --> 00:26:38.029
<i> Motshidi is all
 that matters now.</i>

00:26:56.347 --> 00:27:00.085
<i> Keep her safe, Pula.</i>

00:27:20.338 --> 00:27:25.176
<i> Carry her gently from
 her violent father.</i>

00:27:28.346 --> 00:27:33.184
<i> From everyone, until
 she can hold her own.</i>

00:27:55.606 --> 00:27:59.344
<i> Mmamotse's reign
 begins with chaos.</i>

00:28:02.747 --> 00:28:06.918
<i> Her minions patrol every
 corner of the kingdom.</i>

00:28:20.798 --> 00:28:22.900
<i> The orders are simple.</i>

00:28:23.000 --> 00:28:26.337
<i> No one is above her rule.</i>

00:28:32.910 --> 00:28:36.481
<i> Everyone will pay a price.</i>

00:28:42.086 --> 00:28:46.458
<i> Most would cower in the
 presence of this dragon.</i>

00:28:48.793 --> 00:28:52.330
<i> But Mmamotse sees
 only opportunity.</i>

00:29:04.943 --> 00:29:08.246
<i> Use the beast.</i>

00:29:11.783 --> 00:29:15.019
<i> Let him do the dirty work.</i>

00:29:20.357 --> 00:29:23.194
(gazelle groaning).

00:29:34.672 --> 00:29:38.977 size:81% position:41%
<i> Now take our share.</i>

00:29:50.321 --> 00:29:53.458
<i> Even dragons will
 serve the tyrant.</i>

00:30:20.651 --> 00:30:23.621
<i> She will win this tug of war</i>

00:30:26.291 --> 00:30:28.927
<i> to get ahead.</i>

00:30:35.233 --> 00:30:40.471
<i> There is always more to steal,
 until she conquers everyone.</i>

00:30:54.652 --> 00:31:01.092
♪ ♪

00:31:03.961 --> 00:31:08.132
<i> NARRATOR: The Matahta pride's
 loss hardens their resolve.</i>

00:31:10.434 --> 00:31:14.472
<i> The sisters nurture
 their surviving cubs.</i>

00:31:17.408 --> 00:31:22.080
<i> One day they will take
 on tyrants together.</i>

00:31:29.987 --> 00:31:34.492
<i> But until then, they
 will trust no one.</i>

00:31:46.704 --> 00:31:52.243 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> A drifting vagabond, out
 of place in the new regime.</i>

00:31:55.546 --> 00:32:00.418 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> Sega does not know
 him nor his intentions.</i>

00:32:04.622 --> 00:32:07.558
<i> He could offer protection,</i>

00:32:07.659 --> 00:32:11.329
<i> perhaps even a quick
 path to the throne.</i>

00:32:15.599 --> 00:32:19.170
<i> But at what price?</i>

00:32:21.739 --> 00:32:26.177 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> He could kill all
 their remaining cubs.</i>

00:32:31.916 --> 00:32:36.254
<i> The sisters can't
 risk losing another.</i>

00:32:44.429 --> 00:32:51.035
(roaring).

00:33:13.057 --> 00:33:16.594
<i> Their decision is clear.</i>

00:33:19.563 --> 00:33:24.635
<i> But the wounded hopeful
 still begs for acceptance.</i>

00:33:30.207 --> 00:33:34.245
<i> He needs them more
 than they need him.</i>

00:33:39.883 --> 00:33:43.588
<i> But Sega cannot
 take the chance.</i>

00:33:56.500 --> 00:34:01.372
<i> Their new dynasty is
 far too important.</i>

00:34:09.513 --> 00:34:15.053 align:start position:0%
<i>These warrior sisters will build
their empire on their own.</i>

00:34:37.275 --> 00:34:43.781
(birds chirping).

00:34:50.120 --> 00:34:54.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> Motshidi does not have the
 benefit of the queen's guard.</i>

00:35:00.164 --> 00:35:03.568
<i> But she does have a
 devoted role model.</i>

00:35:18.982 --> 00:35:22.620
<i> Pula is her protector.</i>

00:35:25.056 --> 00:35:28.326
<i> Her provider.</i>

00:35:31.829 --> 00:35:35.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> She will teach her
 everything she needs to know.</i>

00:35:51.982 --> 00:35:56.721 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> Motshidi already
 shares her mother's spirit.</i>

00:36:01.325 --> 00:36:04.795
<i> Curious and bold.</i>

00:36:13.871 --> 00:36:18.543
<i> A young assassin eager to
 explore her forest world.</i>

00:36:28.852 --> 00:36:33.491
(chirping, meowing).

00:36:42.265 --> 00:36:45.903
<i> She has so much to learn.</i>

00:36:57.381 --> 00:37:01.285 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> Savor these
 precious moments, Pula.</i>

00:37:02.319 --> 00:37:05.823 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> Danger is only
 ever a footfall away.</i>

00:37:19.303 --> 00:37:23.007 align:start size:88% position:13% line:0%
<i> NARRATOR: The single
 hyena is a very bad omen.</i>

00:37:30.848 --> 00:37:35.286 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> Where there's one,
 there are always more.</i>

00:37:38.355 --> 00:37:42.393 align:start size:78% position:22%
<i> Pula knows the
 kingdom's tyrants.</i>

00:37:46.830 --> 00:37:50.701 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> But this is Motshidi's
 first encounter.</i>

00:37:54.604 --> 00:37:57.808
<i> They will be here soon.</i>

00:37:59.910 --> 00:38:03.714
<i> Quick! Hide!</i>

00:38:11.988 --> 00:38:16.394
<i> Your tyrant queen may
 think herself a royal.</i>

00:38:27.004 --> 00:38:30.808
<i> But you are a wretched spy.</i>

00:38:32.309 --> 00:38:36.414
<i> We still own the forest.</i>

00:39:05.209 --> 00:39:11.081 line:0%
♪ ♪

00:39:11.314 --> 00:39:14.618
<i> Where are you, little one?</i>

00:39:18.288 --> 00:39:21.892
<i> Did I teach you well?</i>

00:39:50.687 --> 00:39:54.424
<i> Pula is wise and strong.</i>

00:39:55.159 --> 00:40:00.030
<i> A self-made noble
 who earns her power.</i>

00:40:23.286 --> 00:40:26.824 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> If Motshidi follows
 her mother's footsteps,</i>

00:40:26.924 --> 00:40:31.095 align:start size:78% position:22%
<i> one day she will
 inherit this world.</i>

00:40:41.805 --> 00:40:47.511
(elephants rumbling).

00:40:47.778 --> 00:40:51.081
<i> But the walls are closing in.</i>

00:40:54.918 --> 00:40:58.756 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> Flood waters
 surround the kingdom,</i>

00:41:01.191 --> 00:41:06.630
<i> now just an island in
 Botswana's great delta.</i>

00:41:09.032 --> 00:41:12.837
(screaming).

00:41:22.379 --> 00:41:25.649
<i> The realm welcomes a new cat.</i>

00:41:32.490 --> 00:41:37.061
<i> This is no place for
 a cheetah, not now.</i>

00:41:49.539 --> 00:41:54.245 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> Lured in by the promise of
 plenty to feed her three cubs.</i>

00:42:12.129 --> 00:42:17.835
<i> This place certainly seems
 like heaven to this family.</i>

00:42:32.348 --> 00:42:36.754
<i> But little does she know,</i>

00:42:38.556 --> 00:42:43.093 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> Mmamotse's rotten
 clan sees everything.</i>

00:43:00.244 --> 00:43:03.647
<i> This land is no Eden</i>

00:43:04.848 --> 00:43:08.252
<i> for anyone but them.</i>

00:43:18.828 --> 00:43:23.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> The hostile welcome
 exposes her horrible mistake.</i>

00:43:39.082 --> 00:43:43.687 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> This young mother has
 led her family into hell.</i>

00:43:46.390 --> 00:43:52.696 line:0%
<i> Now they're trapped on an
 island ruled by tyrants.</i>

00:43:57.568 --> 00:44:01.171 align:start size:81% position:19% line:0%
<i> But if she navigates
 this nightmare,</i>

00:44:02.272 --> 00:44:06.410 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
<i> she could stake her own
 claim to the Savage Kingdom.</i>

00:44:08.745 --> 00:44:10.080 line:0%
Captioned by Cotter
Captioning Services.

